SUMMARY:MASCP Pupusa Dinner & 40th Anniversary Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Please join us as we joyfully celebrate 40 years of sistering and hear back from our most recent delegations to El Salvador. Featuring a 40 Years of Sistering slideshow\, Salvadoran music\, and silent auction. Sliding scale suggested donation: $4–$40. Everyone welcome!\n\nAccessibility: Wheelchair accessible. Please allow time for neighborhood street parking. Bike parking across the street. Nearby buses: A\, B\, C and 38.
LOCATION:Aubergine\, 1226 Williamson Street\, Madison\, WI
URL:https://mascp.org/rsvp/
